:: Carter Bedroom Play Under Bed [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
For one reason or another, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has a pack of balloons in his toybox. They look a bit old and beat-up. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I think I got those at my last birthday party? No idea how they got in there.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> explains with a shrug and a smile. Naturally, you decide to blow some up and play a game of keepy-uppy with only your feet. <span style="color:LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is pretty agile, though his small legs make it a little difficult for him as he can barely kick high enough to keep them off the ground and almost tumbles into his bookshelves a few times.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Carter",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                },	
            },
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                },	
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I better get my growth spurt before high school, or I’ll-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pauses, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I don’t know, but I’ll do something!”</span> You chuckle, continuing to kick up your balloon when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> just barely manages to kick his up before it hits the ground. <span style="color:Yellow">Unfortunately, the kick sends it into one of his figures that is carrying a sword just sharp enough to poke a hole in the balloon and send it whizzing around at high speeds.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ah!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cries out as both of you dive to the ground, more out of the comedy of it than actually being in danger from the high-speed rubber. It eventually runs out of air as it flies under his bed, deflating into a red mass of latex. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That was funny. You know, we should get those balloons that you let go and they fly around all crazy and make funny noises.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> suggests as he kneels down by his bed, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I should probably grab that before I forget. Dad gets mad if I throw trash under my bed.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:Pink">As he crawls under his bed to grab the little balloon, you can’t help but notice how funny he looks with just his lower half sticking out, the back of his $CarterBottoms.Type emphasizing his butt nicely. Would sure be a shame if someone took advantage of this situation.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
    <<link "Smack his butt<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        With a devious smirk, you kneel down next to the boy and rub your hands together. <span style="color:Pink">You then do an impressive wind-up before – SMACK – you slap <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s butt with as much force as you can muster!</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Carter",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 2,
                },	
            },
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                },	
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ah!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cries out, suddenly snapping up with such speed his mattress bounces a bit. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Don’t do that!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He calls out, but you take that as a challenge, so slap his butt a few more times as he tries to kick and flail about to keep you away. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Stop spanking me!”</span> He says, a hint of laughter in his voice, as you continue to play his butt like a bongo drum the entire time he crawls out from under his bed. <br>
        <br>
        Once he’s free, he immediately tries to tackle you to the ground to get revenge, which leads you both to wrestle each other on the ground for a few minutes until you tire yourselves out.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Okay… okay…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says from deep breaths, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Let’s call a truce, you jerk.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He laughs, smacking your side one more time for good measure, though it is so light you can’t help but laugh it off.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
        <span style="color:red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Carter Bedroom]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Pants him<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        With a devious smirk, you kneel down next to the boy and stretch out your fingers. <span style="color:Pink">You then gingerly move towards the waist of his $CarterBottoms.Name, before suddenly gripping them and yanking them straight down to his ankles! <br>

        <<set _ad to [
