        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ah!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cries out, suddenly snapping up with enough force to cause his mattress to bounce up. You can’t help but break out laughing as, not only is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s $CarterUndies.Name fully exposed, but the speed at which you yanked has caused half of his underwear to slip down further, revealing a good portion of the little boy’s pale, soft butt to you. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“H- hey! Don’t do that! Pull them up right now!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> yells as he kicks about, ironically making it impossible for you to fix his bottoms. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> flails around and struggles to escape the confines of under his bed, all the while you tease and poke fun at his exposed underwear and tosh, lightly tapping it until <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> kicks you away. When he finally does manage to free himself, he quickly fixes his bottoms, face burning red though with a smile, before he tackles you to the ground to try and get his revenge. <br>
        <br>
        This leads to you both wrestling on the ground for a few minutes until you tire yourselves out.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Okay… okay…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says from deep breaths, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Let’s call a truce, you jerk.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He laughs, smacking your side one more time for good measure, though it is so light you can’t help but laugh it off.</span> <br>

